@startuml
!theme mars
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

' Definisi Partisipan
actor "Admin/Teknisi" as User
boundary "Customer Page" as UI
control "Sistem (Backend)" as System
database "Database(customers)" as DB
participant "MikroTik Router" as MT

' ================= FLOW 1: REGISTER CUSTOMER =================
group Registrasi Customer Baru
    User -> UI : 1. Input data customer (nama, email, no HP)
    activate UI
    UI -> UI : 2. Validasi format input
    UI -> System : 3. POST /api/customers {data}
    deactivate UI
    activate System
    
    System -> DB : 4. Cek email/username unik
    activate DB
    DB --> System : 5. Return hasil cek
    deactivate DB
    
    alt Data sudah ada
        System --> UI : 6. Return error: "Data sudah terdaftar"
        deactivate System
        activate UI
        UI --> User : 7. Tampilkan pesan error
        deactivate UI
    else Data unik
        System -> DB : 8. INSERT customers (status=pending)
        activate DB
        DB --> System : 9. Return customer_id
        deactivate DB
        System --> UI : 10. Return {success: true, customer_id}
        deactivate System
        activate UI
        UI --> User : 11. Tampilkan "Customer terdaftar (Pending)"
        deactivate UI
    end
end

' ================= FLOW 2: AKTIVASI & PROVISIONING PPP SECRET =================
group Aktivasi Layanan (Provisioning)
    User -> UI : 12. Pilih customer & klik "Aktifkan"
    activate UI
    UI -> System : 13. POST /api/customers/{id}/activate {profile_id}
    deactivate UI
    activate System
    
    System -> DB : 14. GET customer + bandwidth_profile
    activate DB
    DB --> System : 15. Return data profil (speed, router_id)
    deactivate DB
    
    System -> System : 16. Generate username/password PPPoE
    System -> MT : 17. API: /ppp/secret/add {name, password, profile}
    activate MT
    
    alt Koneksi Router Gagal
        MT --> System : 18. Return error: timeout/unreachable
        deactivate MT
        System --> UI : 19. Return warning: "DB saved, router unreachable"
        deactivate System
        activate UI
        UI --> User : 20. Tampilkan "Perlu sinkronisasi manual"
        deactivate UI
    else Router OK
        MT -> MT : 19. Create PPP Secret + Assign Profile
        MT --> System : 20. Return success
        deactivate MT
        
        System -> DB : 21. UPDATE customers (status=active, ppp_secret_id)
        activate DB
        DB --> System : 22. Update berhasil
        deactivate DB
        
        System --> UI : 23. Return {success: true, credentials}
        deactivate System
        activate UI
        UI --> User : 24. Tampilkan "Aktif! Username/Password dikirim ke customer"
        deactivate UI
    end
end

' ================= FLOW 3: CEK STATUS ONLINE (PPP ACTIVE) =================
group Monitoring Status Customer
    User -> UI : 25. Klik "Cek Koneksi" pada customer
    activate UI
    UI -> System : 26. GET /api/customers/{id}/status
    deactivate UI
    activate System
    
    System -> MT : 27. API: /ppp/active/print (filter by username)
    activate MT
    MT --> System : 28. Return session data (IP, uptime, bytes)
    deactivate MT
    
    alt Session ditemukan (Online)
        System -> DB : 29. UPDATE customers (last_seen, status=online)
        activate DB
        DB --> System : 30. Update berhasil
        deactivate DB
        System --> UI : 31. Return {status: "online", ip, uptime}
        deactivate System
        activate UI
        UI --> User : 32. Tampilkan badge 🟢 Online + detail sesi
        deactivate UI
    else Session tidak ditemukan (Offline)
        System -> DB : 33. UPDATE customers (status=offline)
        activate DB
        DB --> System : 34. Update berhasil
        deactivate DB
        System --> UI : 35. Return {status: "offline"}
        deactivate System
        activate UI
        UI --> User : 36. Tampilkan badge 🔴 Offline
        deactivate UI
    end
end

note right of User
  * PPP Secret: kredensial login customer di MikroTik
  * PPP Active: sesi real-time customer yang sedang online
  * Bandwidth Profile: template speed limit yang di-assign ke PPP Secret
end note

@enduml